   "briefing": [
    {
     "text": "Pope Leo’s four-day French visit includes a call for ethical dialogue to protect social cohesion, alongside a planned speech on AI and Europe’s future.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "c03d74b7665cb7f3",
