       "source": "The Guardian World",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Trump and Xi exchanged cordialities at a White House state dinner, but the meeting produced little progress on their major disputes.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "262b590f746fdd26",
       "title": "Trump and Xi exchange warm words at state dinner but little progress on key issues",
