       "source": "BBC World",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The European Commission has opened infringement proceedings against 26 countries for failing to transpose the gas and hydrogen directive; Italy is the sole country reported in compliance.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "85fdba98c0fd2a02",
       "title": "Infrazione Ue a 26 Paesi su gas e idrogeno, Italia unica in regola",
       "url": "https://www.ansa.it/sito/notizie/topnews/2026/09/25/infrazione-ue-a-26-paesi-su-gas-e-idrogeno-italia-unica-in-regola_0963e7e3-71dd-4d8b-ba3e-a29b1c804e5c.html",
       "source": "ANSA Top News",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Xi acknowledged AI risks during his US visit, while Trump reportedly dismissed them, highlighting a divide over the technology’s hazards.",
     "sources": [
      {
